{title: All Hail the Power of Jesus' Name}
{key: C}
{time: 3/4}

{start_of_verse: 1}
All [C]hail the power of [G]Jesus' [C]name!
Let [C]angels prostrate fall, let [F]angels [G]prostrate [C]fall
Bring [C]forth the [E7]royal [Dm]dia[C]dem
And [F]c[C]ro[G]wn [C]him
[F]Crown him, [G]crown him, [C]crown him
And [F]crown him [G]Lord of [C]all.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
Ye [C]chosen seed of [G]Israel's [C]race
Ye [C]ransomed from the fall, ye [F]ransomed [G]from the [C]fall
Hail [C]him who [E7]saves you [Dm]by his [C]grace
And [F]c[C]ro[G]wn [C]him
[F]Crown him, [G]crown him, [C]crown him
And [F]crown him [G]Lord of [C]all.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
Let [C]every kindred, every [**]tribe
On [C]this terrestrial ball, on [F]this te[G]rrestrial [C]ball
To [C]him all [E7]majes[Dm]ty as[C]cribe
And [F]cr[C]ow[G]n [C]him
[F]Crown him, [G]crown him, [C]crown him
And [F]crown him [G]Lord of [C]all.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 4}
Oh, [C]that with yonder [G]sacred [C]throng
We [C]at his feet may fall, we [F]at his [G]feet may [C]fall!
We'll [C]join the [E7]ever[Dm]lasting [C]song
And [F]c[C]ro[G]wn [C]him
[F]Crown him, [G]crown him, [C]crown him
And [F]crown him [G]Lord of [C]all.
{end_of_verse}
